x87sidecar: compose the AoE IV software-fault and x87 decoders

Require HB_AOE4=1 and the verified-launch marker set by Wine to enable the
bounded decoder and the FBLD deferred-pop correction. Ordinary launches
use the decoder and translator behavior of the pinned upstream commit.

The bounded decoder is by Marc Ibrahim (GameToMac 0.1.5-alpha), carried by
NerRobDog: https://github.com/NerRobDog/x87sidecar/commit/4b6bad8
Decoder composition and FBLD correction:
https://github.com/tarikbc/macgames/tree/1579841b15ce569807b92af95b478c752c26df3d/patches/x87sidecar
The MacGames README at that commit says, "Wine stays LGPL, and x87sidecar and DXMT stay MIT."
https://github.com/tarikbc/macgames/blob/1579841b15ce569807b92af95b478c752c26df3d/README.md#license
Integration and fixtures: https://github.com/himbeles/x87sidecar-aoe4/commit/f028874
License: MIT (see upstream LICENSE).

